# `vercel deploy` from the CLI uploads the local working directory and was
# found (by testing, not assumed) to NOT reliably honor .gitignore for this
# project's layout — a local-only test file with a canary marker was
# uploaded and served by a real deployment despite being gitignored. This
# file is the actual, confirmed-effective way to keep local-only or
# sensitive files out of every deploy.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/annotated/review-state.json
data/annotated/audit-log.json
data/annotated/final-report.json
node_modules
.git
